// 1. Property photo filling the top of the frame (light-grey placeholder #EEF0EF when missing)
// 2. "NOVO IMÓVEL" pill, coral #F06052, white 800 italic uppercase, top-left
// 3. Blue panel #05B8E6 covering the bottom ~40%, its top edge a straight slash rising to the right
// 4. Price tag: white square box on the seam, aligned right, ink #213D56 800 italic text
// 5. Location eyebrow "LISBOA · ALVALADE", white 600 uppercase, wide tracking
// 6. Headline "T3 COM VARANDA", white 800 italic uppercase
// 7. Facts line "120 m² · 3 quartos · 2 WC · garagem", white 500
// 8. CTA pill, coral, "Ligue já +351 …" white 800 italic
// 9. Agent avatar: circle photo with a white ring (grey placeholder when missing)
// 10. Agent name "Manuel Reis", white 700
